[36m│[0m cannot supply. A parity vector for those would therefore be unfalsifiable    [36m│[0m
[36m│[0m against the current port — the harness could not grade it honestly. This     [36m│[0m
[36m│[0m includes the two half-cent-tie captures (`T46-CH-03` → `4.73`, `T46-CH-04` → [36m│[0m
[36m│[0m `2.03`) that would exercise the `HALF_UP` rounding mode; they remain         [36m│[0m
